ally-optimal-solutions-for-the-ava--64cad93bb7ab.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-electromagnetically-induced-transparency-enables-deterministic-reversible-mappin--b76e4e96d4f0.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-experimental-energy-estimates-are-limited-by-photon-source-impurity-photon-disti--780254eb8ba5.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-for-the-demonstrated-4x4-hamiltonian-the-quantum-expectation-estimation-approach--8aea71f20a05.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-for-the-hardest-reported-random-circuit-sampling-task-sycamore-produced-one-mill--07db9778c4a3.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-full-density-matrix-characterization-becomes-an-impractical-verification-strateg--65a0be3566e1.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-hamiltonian-expectation-values-for-a-broad-class-of-physical-systems-reduce-to-s--ed045d2a43b4.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-highly-entangled-quantum-dynamics-is-the-most-natural-arena-for-meaningful-quant--3b6f2f5ba268.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-hybrid-qaoa-and-vqe-approaches-are-plausible-nisq-era-testbeds-but-their-ability--31ec67369767.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-large-quantum-networks-require-reversible-interconnects-that-convert-quantum-sta--03b0b3a11218.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-large-scale-quantum-random-access-memory-and-quantum-state-readout-constraints-c--fa6ae1d801a4.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-linear-cross-entropy-benchmarking-provides-a-fidelity-measure-by-comparing-exper--4abac38b173d.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-lower-gate-error-rates-matter-both-because-they-allow-larger-uncorrected-nisq-ci--043e58605f51.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-measured-component-error-rates-under-simultaneous-operation-were-low-enough-to-s--6d6ae35745de.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-nelder-mead-direct-search-was-more-robust-than-gradient-descent-for-the-noisy-ph--c886fbe39dc2.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-nisq-computers-with-roughly-50-to-a-few-hundred-qubits-mark-a-classically-hard-s--2d5ec194bedf.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-nisq-devices-are-best-understood-as-experimental-tools-for-exploring-many-body-q--fde7f9646dbb.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-noise-resilient-circuit-design-can-extend-nisq-computational-reach-but-it-may-tr--aed4bcfeaa39.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-basic-linear-algebra-subroutines-provide-exponential-speedups-for-fourie--009e83ff60b6.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-boltzmann-machine-training-can-gain-quadratic-improvements-in-thermaliza--2d6a13e72831.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-computers-are-not-expected-to-efficiently-solve-hard-np-hard-combinatori--0d5f718c4d47.json\n/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-computers-have-credible-grounds-for-super-classical-power-because-of-kno--2f85bd581bbb.jso