{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"set -euo pipefail\nCTX='/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/outputs/space_overview/subspace--quantum-physics/context.json'\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '--- relation type counts ---'\njq -r '.relations | group_by(.relation_type)[] | {relation_type:.[0].relation_type, count:length} | @json' \\\"\"'$CTX\"\nprintf '\"'%s\\\\n' '--- relation rationales ---'\njq -r '.relations[] | [.relation_type, .src_claim_id, .dst_claim_id, .rationale] | @json' \\\"\"'$CTX\"'","aggregated_output":"--- relation type counts ---\n{\"relation_type\":\"derived_from\",\"count\":5}\n{\"relation_type\":\"falsifies\",\"count\":2}\n{\"relation_type\":\"similar\",\"count\":4}\n{\"relation_type\":\"supports\",\"count\":19}\n--- relation rationales ---\n[\"derived_from\",\"claim-dark-state-adiabatic-control-can-reversibly-map-a-single-photon-optical-field-in--55c6ef7fe1ba\",\"claim-large-quantum-networks-require-reversible-interconnects-that-convert-quantum-sta--03b0b3a11218\",\"The dark-state mapping protocol instantiates the general reversible-interconnect requirement.\"]\n[\"derived_from\",\"claim-highly-entangled-quantum-dynamics-is-the-most-natural-arena-for-meaningful-quant--3b6f2f5ba268\",\"claim-quantum-computers-have-credible-grounds-for-super-classical-power-because-of-kno--2f85bd581bbb\",\"The special promise of quantum dynamics follows from the broader argument that highly entangled systems resist classical simulation.\"]\n[\"derived_from\",\"claim-quantum-principal-component-analysis-can-diagonalize-a-covariance-like-density-m--6ee32a171ac2\",\"claim-quantum-basic-linear-algebra-subroutines-provide-exponential-speedups-for-fourie--009e83ff60b6\",\"qPCA applies qBLAS-style density-matrix and eigenvalue routines to a specific machine learning task.\"]\n[\"derived_from\",\"claim-the-hhl-linear-system-algorithm-can-output-a-quantum-state-proportional-to-a-sol--9531ddbd1acc\",\"claim-quantum-basic-linear-algebra-subroutines-provide-exponential-speedups-for-fourie--009e83ff60b6\",\"HHL is one of the linear-algebra primitives that underwrite quantum machine learning speedup claims.\"]\n[\"derived_from\",\"claim-the-quantum-variational-eigensolver-prepares-approximate-ground-states-by-using--0037de1d8464\",\"claim-hamiltonian-expectation-values-for-a-broad-class-of-physical-systems-reduce-to-s--ed045d2a43b4\",\"QVE uses QEE's Pauli-expectation estimation as the measurement subroutine inside its variational loop.\"]\n[\"falsifies\",\"claim-circuit-depth-and-implementation-overhead-can-become-prohibitive-for-nominally-e--07b698d82789\",\"claim-quantum-machine-learning-can-outperform-classical-algorithms-on-specific-pattern--ade088c638d0\",\"Large circuit overhead can make asymptotic speedups impractical on realistic machines.\"]\n[\"falsifies\",\"claim-large-scale-quantum-random-access-memory-and-quantum-state-readout-constraints-c--fa6ae1d801a4\",\"claim-quantum-machine-learning-can-outperform-classical-algorithms-on-specific-pattern--ade088c638d0\",\"Input and output bottlenecks can prevent end-to-end advantage even when an internal quantum subroutine is faster.\"]\n[\"similar\",\"claim-dark-state-adiabatic-control-can-reversibly-map-a-single-photon-optical-field-in--55c6ef7fe1ba\",\"claim-electromagnetically-induced-transparency-enables-deterministic-reversible-mappin--b76e4e96d4f0\",\"Both claims concern reversible mapping between optical fields and matter memories, using different physical platforms.\"]\n[\"similar\",\"claim-device-ansatz-strategies-can-provide-variationally-optimal-solutions-for-the-ava--64cad93bb7ab\",\"claim-unitary-coupled-cluster-ansatz-states-can-be-represented-with-polynomially-many--7f92a3b77387\",\"Both claims concern ansatz choice as the bridge between available quantum hardware and useful variational states.\"]\n[\"similar\",\"claim-for-the-hardest-reported-random-circuit-sampling-task-sycamore-produced-one-mill--07db9778c4a3\",\"claim-the-demonstrated-speedup-is-specific-to-random-circuit-sampling-and-does-not-rem--47d4f349751e\",\"Both claims delimit the demonstration as a task-specific milestone rather than a general-purpose fault-tolerant quantum computer.\"]\n[\"similar\",\"claim-hybrid-qaoa-and-vqe-approaches-are-plausible-nisq-era-testbeds-but-their-ability--31ec67369767\",\"claim-quantum-computers-are-not-expected-to-efficiently-solve-hard-np-hard-combinatori--0d5f718c4d47\",\"Both claims temper optimization expectations by emphasizing hard classical baselines and unresolved quantum advantage.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-agreement-among-full-patch-elided-and-predicted-fidelities-on-classically-verifi--c34d4d1d9279\",\"claim-the-largest-elided-53-qubit-20-cycle-circuits-yielded-f-xeb-2-24-0-21-10-3-over--0a24f12d0686\",\"Agreement among verification variants supports extending the elided-circuit fidelity estimate into the harder regime.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-atomic-ensemble-experiments-had-achieved-stored-heralded-entanglement-high-retri--7d38956d9ede\",\"claim-the-dlcz-protocol-creates-heralded-entanglement-between-atomic-ensembles-by-inte--aa516185d3b2\",\"The stored-entanglement experiments demonstrate key laboratory capabilities presupposed by the DLCZ protocol.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-current-two-qubit-gate-and-measurement-error-rates-imply-that-uncorrected-nisq-c--68f47af68b82\",\"claim-nisq-computers-with-roughly-50-to-a-few-hundred-qubits-mark-a-classically-hard-s--2d5ec194bedf\",\"The two-qubit error and thousand-gate estimates explain why NISQ scale does not by itself produce deep reliable computation.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-experimental-energy-estimates-are-limited-by-photon-source-impurity-photon-disti--780254eb8ba5\",\"claim-the-photonic-variational-eigensolver-experimentally-recovered-the-he-h-bond-diss--5898494f9b1f\",\"The reported molecular energy result is qualified by the measured systematic and statistical error budget.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-for-the-demonstrated-4x4-hamiltonian-the-quantum-expectation-estimation-approach--8aea71f20a05\",\"claim-quantum-expectation-estimation-reduces-coherent-evolution-demands-relative-to-ph--e17864953251\",\"The CNOT comparison is a concrete instance of the broader coherent-resource reduction claim.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-full-density-matrix-characterization-becomes-an-impractical-verification-strateg--65a0be3566e1\",\"claim-scalable-quantum-networks-are-likely-to-be-heterogeneous-systems-that-combine-ca--dfe53fef0772\",\"The scaling barrier for verification motivates stronger procedures for heterogeneous scalable networks.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-lower-gate-error-rates-matter-both-because-they-allow-larger-uncorrected-nisq-ci--043e58605f51\",\"claim-scalable-fault-tolerant-quantum-computing-depends-on-quantum-error-correction-bu--cf48bc246343\",\"Lower gate error rates reduce both near-term circuit failure and the future overhead required for fault-tolerant operation.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-measured-component-error-rates-under-simultaneous-operation-were-low-enough-to-s--6d6ae35745de\",\"claim-the-largest-random-circuits-combined-53-qubits-1-113-single-qubit-gates-430-two--c8ece98aae87\",\"Measured simultaneous component errors provide the inputs for predicting whole-circuit fidelity.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-noise-resilient-circuit-design-can-extend-nisq-computational-reach-but-it-may-tr--aed4bcfeaa39\",\"claim-nisq-computers-with-roughly-50-to-a-few-hundred-qubits-mark-a-classically-hard-s--2d5ec194bedf\",\"Noise-resilient design is presented as a way to stretch, but not remove, the noise-imposed limits of NISQ devices.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-quantum-basic-linear-algebra-subroutines-provide-exponential-speedups-for-fourie--009e83ff60b6\",\"claim-quantum-machine-learning-can-outperform-classical-algorithms-on-specific-pattern--ade088c638d0\",\"Exponential qBLAS speedups are a core mechanism behind the broader claim that quantum learning can accelerate data analysis.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-quantum-boltzmann-machine-training-can-gain-quadratic-improvements-in-thermaliza--2d6a13e72831\",\"claim-deep-quantum-learning-can-use-quantum-annealers-programmable-photonic-circuits-a--0bdb973219c3\",\"Quadratic Boltzmann training improvements explain why special-purpose quantum hardware is relevant to deep quantum learning.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-quantum-machine-learning-for-quantum-data-can-reduce-tomography-and-characteriza--b02ec76133c0\",\"claim-quantum-machine-learning-can-outperform-classical-algorithms-on-specific-pattern--ade088c638d0\",\"Quantum data analysis provides a natural setting where quantum systems avoid some classical data-loading costs.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-random-quantum-circuits-become-exponentially-harder-to-simulate-classically-as-q--f7cd81f80f31\",\"claim-for-the-hardest-reported-random-circuit-sampling-task-sycamore-produced-one-mill--07db9778c4a3\",\"The exponential classical scaling of random circuits explains why the reported runtime gap grows at the largest width and depth.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-scalable-fault-tolerant-quantum-computing-depends-on-quantum-error-correction-bu--cf48bc246343\",\"claim-nisq-devices-are-best-understood-as-experimental-tools-for-exploring-many-body-q--fde7f9646dbb\",\"The overhead and distance of fault tolerance support the claim that NISQ is a stepping stone rather than an immediate transformation.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-strong-cavity-qed-coupling-supplies-a-physical-regime-in-which-individual-atoms--9807d4e35625\",\"claim-large-quantum-networks-require-reversible-interconnects-that-convert-quantum-sta--03b0b3a11218\",\"Strong cavity-QED coupling is one physical mechanism for the reversible light-matter interconnects required by networks.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-the-demonstrated-integrated-photonic-processor-prepares-and-measures-arbitrary-t--f41a0c8f645b\",\"claim-the-photonic-variational-eigensolver-experimentally-recovered-the-he-h-bond-diss--5898494f9b1f\",\"The two-qubit photonic processor supplies the implemented platform used to measure the He-H+ dissociation curve.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-the-dlcz-protocol-creates-heralded-entanglement-between-atomic-ensembles-by-inte--aa516185d3b2\",\"claim-large-quantum-networks-require-reversible-interconnects-that-convert-quantum-sta--03b0b3a11218\",\"DLCZ ensemble entanglement supplies a second grounded route for distributing coherence between network nodes.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-the-largest-elided-53-qubit-20-cycle-circuits-yielded-f-xeb-2-24-0-21-10-3-over--0a24f12d0686\",\"claim-for-the-hardest-reported-random-circuit-sampling-task-sycamore-produced-one-mill--07db9778c4a3\",\"The measured elided-circuit fidelity is needed for the equal-fidelity runtime comparison behind the speedup claim.\"]\n[\"supports\",\"claim-the-near-term-viability-of-quantum-machine-learning-depends-on-solving-input-out--0091df09ad90\",\"claim-large-scale-quantum-random-access-memory-and-quantum-state-readout-constraints-c--fa6ae1d801a4\",\"The review's future-work caveats explicitly include the input and output problems.\"]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
